Z||000000||JBGehling||03-08-2001||07:36 PM||||Hey, <BR>I got this car about a month ago, my dad bought it for me from a guy here in town. The car has 57,000 miles on it and runs and looks nearly perfect! Too slow for my tastes, but it sure looks fantastic!<P>BTW, I've since put the PONTIAC decal on the hood, but I haven't gotten a chance to take any pictures with it on yet  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/IndyFront.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/IndyDriving.jpg"> <P>Sorry these pics are so blurry!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/IndySide.jpg"> <P>MMMMM... it's best angle! I think the aero nose with notchback rear-end is VERY stylish!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/IndyBack.jpg"> <P>That's all for now, what do you think?!<P>JOsh||||reg||1
